If you can only count up to one lion, I am not going lion hunting with you.
 The chances of being seriously outnumbered (in some, to you perverse, way)
are too great.  I say that, if there is a lion on the left and one on the
right, there are two lions, not one, and it's going to take at least two
bullets to get rid of them.

